  "chatDemoNotice": "Demo · Sample replies and products",
  "chatDemoGreeting": "Hi, I’m Ming Sros! I can show you meal ideas, ingredient lists, and simple recipes. What would you like to try?",
  "chatDemoMealReply": "How about rice with stir-fried greens and an egg? Here are the ingredients. Tap one to browse sample products, or ask me for the recipe.",
  "chatDemoIngredientsReply": "For rice with stir-fried greens and an egg, you’ll need:",
  "chatDemoFreshReply": "Here are a few sample picks from our market. Tap an item to see its product details and try adding it to your basket.",
  "chatDemoRecipeReply": "Rice with stir-fried greens & egg\nServes 2\n\n1. Rinse 1 cup of rice and cook according to the packet instructions.\n2. Wash and chop the greens. Heat a little oil in a pan and stir-fry until tender. Season to taste.\n3. Fry or scramble 2 eggs until cooked through.\n4. Serve the greens and eggs over the rice. Enjoy!",
  "chatDemoLokLakReply": "For beef lok lak, you’ll need:\n\n• Beef (sirloin or ribeye)\n• Soy sauce\n• Oyster sauce\n• Garlic\n• Black pepper\n• Lettuce\n• Tomato\n• Onion\n• Lime\n\nAsk me for the recipe next!",
  "chatDemoLokLakRecipe": "Beef lok lak\nServes 2\n\n1. Cut 300 g of beef into bite-size pieces. Mix with 1 tbsp soy sauce, 1 tbsp oyster sauce, 2 minced garlic cloves, and black pepper. Marinate for 15 minutes.\n2. Arrange washed lettuce, sliced tomato, and onion on a plate.\n3. Heat a little oil in a pan. Stir-fry the beef in small batches until cooked to your liking.\n4. Serve over the vegetables with rice. Mix lime juice and black pepper for a dipping sauce.",
  "chatDemoThanks": "You’re welcome! Would you like another meal idea, some fresh picks, or a recipe?",
  "chatDeliveryReply": "Open Explore or Categories and tap the location in the header to choose your delivery address. Use the map, search, or enter an address, then save it. You can review your address and delivery choices in the checkout preview.",
  "chatOrdersReply": "Tap Orders in the navigation bar to see your active orders and order history. This preview cannot look up or change an order. For general shopping questions, you can also find help in Profile.",
  "chatFallbackReply": "In this demo, I can help with meal ideas, ingredients, recipes, fresh picks, and shopping questions. Try “Help me plan a meal” or “What ingredients do I need?”",
